          "verdict": "malicious",
          "analysis": "The binary is a DDoS bot for the ARMv7 architecture. It connects to a command-and-control server, parses commands, and launches a variety of network flood attacks. Malicious behaviors include daemonization, use of raw sockets for custom packet crafting, and implementing numerous attack methods such as TCP/UDP floods (`SendUDP`, `SendSTD`), HTTP floods (`httpattack`), and specialized attacks targeting game servers (`vseattack`) and services behind Cloudflare (`CF-KILL`, `SendCloudflare`). The `processCmd` function acts as a dispatcher for these explicitly named attack commands.",
